{"results": [{"name": "The Fabulous", "entity_id": "8D66B343-5462-40F2-A2EC-5929D2A4E825", "types": ["urn:entity:brand"], "properties": {"akas": [], "description": "An award-winning mobile application dedicated to personal transformation through the application of behavioral science. By providing users with structured coaching, guided meditations, and habit-building tools, the platform helps individuals overcome procrastination and prioritize self-care in their daily routines. It serves as a digital accountability partner, transforming complex psychological research into actionable, bite-sized tasks. The brand appeals to a wide range of individuals looking to enhance their productivity and overall mental wellbeing through small, incremental changes.", "external": {"instagram": {"id": "thefabstory"}}, "founded_year": "2013", "image": {"url": "https://images.qloo.com/i/8D66B343-5462-40F2-A2EC-5929D2A4E825-420x-auto.jpg"}, "short_description": "The Fabulous is an award-winning self-care coaching app that uses behavioral science to help users build healthy habits and improve productivity.", "short_descriptions": [{"language": "es", "value": "Una aplicación de coaching premiada que utiliza ciencia conductual para ayudar a los usuarios a crear hábitos saludables y mejorar su productividad diaria."}, {"language": "en", "value": "An award-winning coaching application that utilizes behavioral science to help individuals cultivate sustainable healthy habits and improve their daily productivity."}, {"language": "fr", "value": "Une application de coaching primée qui utilise les sciences comportementales pour aider les utilisateurs à adopter des habitudes saines et à améliorer leur productivité quotidienne."}, {"language": "de", "value": "Eine preisgekrönte Coaching-App, die verhaltenswissenschaftliche Methoden nutzt, um Nutzern beim Aufbau gesunder Gewohnheiten und der Steigerung ihrer Produktivität zu helfen."}]}, "popularity": 0.9540353613263041, "disambiguation": "", "tags":